  body: "# Overseas contributions: qualification and amount\n\n## Source-backed proposal\n\nThe captured reduced-rate
    section distinguishes overseas contributions that may count towards its minimum qualifying period from contributions
    included when determining the State Pension amount.\n\n## Scope and exceptions\n\nThe section is scoped by DMG
    74151 to people without pre-commencement qualifying years. No international aggregation entitlement or rate
    is decided. Country, agreement, residence, date and transitional provisions require separate evidence.\n\n##
    Inspected passages\n\n- [DMG 74151, PDF page 13](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69d8f255d3e08b8871b665ab/dmg-Ch-74.pdf#page=13).\n\
    - [DMG 74154, PDF page 14](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69d8f255d3e08b8871b665ab/dmg-Ch-74.pdf#page=14).\n\
    - [DMG 74162, PDF page 14](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69d8f255d3e08b8871b665ab/dmg-Ch-74.pdf#page=14).\n\
    \n## Provenance and review\n\nIndependent experimental interpretation of DWP guidance, not an official DWP document.
    All definitions and relationships are model-assisted and unreviewed. No individual eligibility, award, legal
    conclusion or executable rule is supplied.\n\nSource observation, listing-page update, printed revision, stated
    legal date and pension event date have separate meanings. PDF page numbers are one-based file positions; extraction
    may damage reading order, footnotes and characters. No visual PDF or specialist acceptance is claimed.\n\n-
    `dmg-vol12-ch74` — PDF SHA-256 `5961a9cb7c86814a0f6fa147c0a8a551b4258c803680fac14a95cab9eca1afd6`; page-extraction
    SHA-256 `c762e93940b4342d70d5bc96a80c3e094c91852d93868f5709e04f293faef61a`.\n"
